00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.100
And then
you fall off the stage.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.634
-Yeah.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.133
-What was going --
What's the real story?

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:53.534
