00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:07.667
If you don't know what a coccyx
is, it's the bone in your ass.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.868
-Okay. Oh, okay. Yeah.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.400
-Yeah, it's from --
If you've ever seen

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.033
"Napoleon Dynamite,"
Uncle Rico says,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.400
"Grandma took
a spill at the dunes.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.734
She broke her coccyx."
Yeah.

00:01:15.734 --> 00:01:18.367
-That's a good reference.
-So, I thought he was joking.

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:19.734
He was like,
"I broke my coccyx."

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:21.234
-He broke his coccyx?
-Or he bruised it.

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:22.734
And I was like, "Oh, that's..."

00:01:22.734 --> 00:01:23.734
He was like, "No, for real."

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.300
So he couldn't,
like, walk or sit

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.901
and he had, like,
a tushy pillow that he was --

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:29.100
It was just really cool
to see, like,

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.734
the most
gangster, thug dude I know

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.534
