00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.734
And he went --
he went, "Oh, no."

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:14.501
And it was such a slow fall,
we had time for him to go,

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:18.100
"Oh, no," and I went,
"You're a [bleep] moron."

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.934
And --
-It was that slow of a fall.

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:21.100
-It was that slow.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.067
